      "text": "Every new document opens with a cover page in the Editorial layout: logo at the top, the title a third of the way down, today's date below. The Cover page section of the theme panel changes all of it: four layouts (Classic, Editorial, Banner, Minimal), a switch for every field, and a slider for the title size.",
